  -- surface used by the separator API. Finish this after the surface is repaired.
  sorry

/-- Helper for Example 15.91.9: if a polynomial uses no variable `T_(N+1)`, then the stage
separator agrees with the polynomial-part map reduced modulo `X^(N+1)`. -/
theorem secondBeauvilleLaszloCounterexample_separator_of_fresh_polynomial
    {N : ℕ} {p : MvPolynomial BeauvilleLaszloCounterexampleVar k}
    (hfresh : BeauvilleLaszloCounterexampleVar.t N ∉ p.vars) :
